[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="UIRoot/MainHUD/ModalsLayer/AboutModal/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=2057719133]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Deadlock 3D Playground[/b] | [color=#8A8A8A]by Julián Caceres[/color]
[color=#A35A4E]Version 0.1.0-alpha[/color]

An open-source, community-driven tool designed to view, inspect, and pose 3D character models from Valve's Deadlock for art reference, virtual photography, and content creation.

[b]Built With & Open Source Credits[/b]
• [b]Engine:[/b] Powered by [url=https://godotengine.org/]Godot Engine 4[/url] (.NET / C#).
• [b]Asset Pipeline:[/b] Powered by [url=https://github.com/ValveResourceFormat/ValveResourceFormat]ValveResourceFormat (Source 2 Viewer)[/url], maintained by the Steam Database community.
• [b]Assets: [/b] Intro Background by [url=https://ayeaka.itch.io/ayeaka]ayeaka[/url]
• [b]Project Source:[/b] Check out the code and contribute on [url=https://github.com/juliancz-a/deadlock-3d-playground]GitHub[/url].

[b]Legal Disclaimer & Intellectual Property[/b]
Deadlock, Source 2, the Source 2 logo, Valve, and the Valve logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of [b]Valve Corporation[/b]. All character models, textures, animations, and related assets extracted or rendered by this application are the copyrighted property of Valve Corporation.

This project is an unofficial, non-commercial fan creation. It is neither affiliated with, endorsed by, nor sponsored by Valve Corporation. No proprietary game files are bundled, redistributed, or sold with this software; assets are parsed locally from the user's personal installation of Deadlock."

